Vendored third-party source: Zig stage1 wasm2c
================================================

The following files in this directory are copied VERBATIM from the Zig
project's `stage1/` directory (https://github.com/ziglang/zig, path
`stage1/`). They are the small, self-contained WebAssembly-to-C translator
Zig uses to bootstrap itself from `zig1.wasm` on any platform with a C
compiler. We vendor them here to give the Coil compiler the same property:
a platform-agnostic C bootstrap built from a committed `.wasm` seed.

  wasm2c.c        the translator (wasm -> C)         [MODIFIED — see below]
  FuncGen.h       per-function codegen state         (pristine)
  InputStream.h   little-endian / LEB128 reader       [MODIFIED — see below]
  wasm.h          opcode / section / valtype enums    (pristine)
  panic.h         panic() helper                      (pristine)
  config.h.in     upstream build config template      (pristine, UNUSED here)
  zig.h           runtime for Zig's OTHER wasm2c      (pristine, UNUSED here)
  wasi.c          WASI runtime                        (pristine, UNUSED here)
  LICENSE-ZIG     the MIT (Expat) license these files ship under

